      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "classified_as": [
        {
          "id": "aat:300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "descriptive note"
        }
      ],
      "content": "Woad: a blue dyestuff prepared from the leaves of Isatis tinctoria, powdered and fermented (OED s.v. woad n.1). Latin gualda/gualdum. Not to be confused with the timber 'wood' (homonym, see wood) nor with weld, the yellow dye of Reseda luteola (see welde)."
    }
  ],
